taging.\n---\n**THE GOLFING GATHERING:** One headset, many saboteurs! Friends join FREE on phones (www.fruitgolf.com) to wreak fruity havoc.\ud83d\ude08\n---\n**SOLO PRACTICE:** Hone your swing, conquer challenges, and enjoy the hilarious physics of Fruit Golf\n---\n{1221193462578863}\n**Pick Your Perfect Fruit!** Every fruit isn't just a ball, it's a strategy! Each has unique physics to master.\n{1430788861608346}\n**Unlocks & Customization!** Style your swing! Complete challenges to unlock gear and turn every round into a fruit-smashing fashion statement.\n{1309311774534866}\n{1840725370201823}\n**UNIQUE FRUIT PHYSICS!** \ud83c\udf4d Discover how each fruit plays.\n---\n\n**CREATIVE OBSTACLES!** \ud83e\udd88 Floppy Sharks, Dust Devils, Dynamite, Zombie Arms, Mouse Traps, and Many More!\n---\n\n**UNLIMITED FUN!** \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Themed courses where you can mix and match obstacles.\n{1254350492851750}\n\n\n", "short_description": "Have you ever dreamt of putting a pineapple down a pirate ship as your friends place sharks and explosive barrels in front of you in attempts to sabotage a perfect golf swing?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coal Car Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/contact-us", "website_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SOCIAL", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input